1 NOTE {geni:about_me} She was born in Eisenach, Germany, in Thuringia. Her father was Johann Weidemann, who worked as the town clerk in Arnstadt.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Johann Christoph Bach in 1667. They had at least seven children.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was quite ill towards the end of her life. At the time of her death, she and Johann were living in some government housing rent-free, because her was the musician for the Prince of Eisenach. She died there. Her husband died ju
2 CONC st ten days later.
