2 CONT
2 CONT Maria Wiedemann Bach 1647–1703
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse Anna Hoffman Bach 1687–1739
2 CONT
2 CONT Children Photo	 Johann Heinrich Bach 1709–1789
2 CONT
2 CONT Johann Wilhelm Bach 1722–1794
2 CONT
