1 NOTE {geni:about_me} She was born in Rodach, Germany. Her father was John Hoffman.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Johann Heinrich Bach in 1737 and they had at least four children: John (born 1738), Henry (born 1743), Joseph (born 1745), and a daughter whose name may have been Anna (born 1755).
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna, her husband, and their 2-year-old son John sailed to America in 1740. They settled on some land along Crooked Creek, near where it joins the Robinson River. She and her husband lived there for the rest of their lives, and th
2 CONC ey were buried there as well.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT * https://sites.rootsweb.com/~bachgenealogy/
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/167724221/anna-maria-bach
