1 NOTE   BAUGH in Pulaski Co. KY by Frank Deis
2 CONT  http://www.rci.rutgers.edu/~deis/bau4.html
2 CONT  Leonard appears on the 1810 census of Berkely Co. VA (now WV) with a
2 CONT  large family, which appears to have 5 boys and 6 girls. Other records of
2 CONT  this family have not been found to date. Mary Louise Bone wrote a paper
2 CONT  (MLB) about a branch of the Baugh family which moved west from
2 CONT Pennsylvania. She says that there were three brothers -- "Michael was
2 CONT  born in 1793 ... [or] about 1775. ... It is known that Michael's brother
2 CONT  George lived in Vincennes, Indiana and that his brother Jacob moved to
2 CONT  Iowa." From the given names in this family, it seems a very strong
2 CONT  possibility that these are descendants of Bartle Bach, but they can not
2 CONT  be, as Ms. Bone suggests, sons of our Adam Baugh. There may be some
2 CONT confusion about which generation is which. This Michael had children
2 CONT named Sara (b. 1817), George Hayes (b. 1818), Leonard (b. 1819) and
2 CONT  Jonathan (b. 1821) all evidently born in Pickaway Co. OH. Could Michael
2 CONT  be a son of Leonard Baugh, or possibly a younger son of Adam Jr., and a
2 CONT grandson of Adam Sr.? The similarity of naming in this family strongly
2 CONT  suggests a connection. But recently I heard from Russ Ehler email
2 CONT  Zwonk@aol.com who said:
2 CONT  "My forebear Conrad Butt/Conrad Botte, a Hessian soldier, reportedly
2 CONT  deserted the British army in October 1777 with a friend, Leonard
2 CONT  Bach/Baugh. Both are supposed to have married English women. Both
2 CONT ended up in Pickaway Co, OH where they died. Of interest to me is that
2 CONT Conrad Butt's daughter married Leonard Bach/Baugh's son George and
2 CONT these went on to live on Parke Co, IN where I found their graves late last
2 CONT fall."
2 CONT  If you are interested in the Baughs of Pickaway Co. OH or Parke Co., IN
2 CONT  please contact Russ Ehler.
1 CHAN
2 DATE 04 DEC 2014
3 TIME 20:00:42
0 @I6000000005234654540@ INDI
