2 CONT George stayed on the family farm in Wythe Co. VA when Henry moved out
2 CONT to Kentucky. He died there, leaving a will (1827) which names his wife
2 CONT  Elizabeth and his children: George Jr. b. 1780, Henry b. 1781 who married
2 CONT  Elizabeth, Elizabeth Wiseman b. 1788, Peter b. 1792, Margaret Etter b.
2 CONT  1793, Mary Blackard b. 1796, David b. 1800 who married Catharine, and
2 CONT  Joseph b. 1803 who married Barbara (birth dates approximate). It is
2 CONT  interesting that none of his male heirs stayed in Virginia or went to
2 CONT  Kentucky -- these Baughs all settled in Indiana, specifically in Lawrence
2 CONT  Co. and Monroe Co. IN. His son Henry married Elizabeth Miller (daughter
2 CONT  of Martin Jr. & Mary), which helps to distinguish him from the other
2 CONT  Henry Baughs.
