1 NAME Elizabeth /Hoffman/ adopted by Maggard
2 GIVN Elizabeth
2 SURN Hoffman
2 NSFX adopted by Maggard
2 _MARNM Back
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Maggard Cemetery, Partridge, Letcher County, Kentucky, USA
