2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. Joseph Jr. (born about 1773) who married a woman whose first name was Sarah.
2 CONT * 2. '''John (born Nov. 19, 1774) who married Catherine Robertson'''.
2 CONT * 3. Mary (born Nov. 1, 1777) who had a son Alfred Back, and then died.
2 CONT * 4. Henry (born Feb. 6, 1785) who married Susannah Maggard.
2 CONT
2 CONT
