2 CONT
2 CONT Note: His last name was not spelled as "Bach." Nearly 100 years after he died, in 1952, some people made a gravestone that misspelled his last name as "Bach," and misspelled his wife's maiden name as "Robinson," and they put it ne
2 CONC xt to the stone sarcophagus, under which John and his wife had been buried (see the attached newspaper article, and read below).
2 CONT
