1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/98447943/casper_hoover
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Came to the US in on November 1st, 1763 via the Ship "Chance".  The ship sailed from Rotterdam, "but last from Cowes" to Philadelphia.  Ship's manifest shows 97 souls on board, and 193 ? in freight.
2 CONT
2 CONT Zion Reformed Church in Hagerstown, MD has a record that daughter Catherine was born and baptized there in 1772.
2 CONT
2 CONT Caspar/ Casper Hoover was on of the earliest settlers of this township, and resided on the farm lately owned by Benjamin Hauger. His children were George, Catharine, Michael, Frederick, Daniel, Susannah, Eva and David. 
