1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Alfred Back was born 27 Dec 1806 in Harlan County, Kentucky, and died 8 Apr 1889 in Menifee County, Kentucky. Buried in Dan Ridge, Menifee, Kentucky..
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Mary Back & John Colyer, born out of wedlock.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alfred Back married  Isabel Caudill on March 20, 1830 in Harlan, Kentucky.  Their children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT #   Elizabeth Collier Back Back (1830 - 1895)*
2 CONT #   Henry Back (1833 - 1914)*
2 CONT #   John Wesley Back (1835 - 1908)*
2 CONT #   Joseph D. Back (1838 - 1864)*
2 CONT #   Alfred Back (1840 - 1920)*
2 CONT #   Benjamin Back (1843 - 1908)*
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Alfred (husband of Isabelle Caudill) was born in Kentucky
