2 CONT Her full name was Charity Frances Grider, but she always went by Frances. Her parents were Martin Grider Sr. and Sarah Coffee. She married Charles Back around 1815. She is buried next to him. She died age 80 years, 1 month and 17 
2 CONC days. They had at least eight children.
