1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sometime betwen 1834 and 1838, Silas and his wife Sarah Collins moved from Kentucky to Bradley County, Tennesee, and remained in TN at least until 1851, when their last child was born. He died sometime after 1880
2 CONT Sarah A. Collins Sex: F Birth: ABT 1807 in Ky. Death: AFT 1880 in Carroll Co. Ar.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Silas Marion Wann b: ABT 1804 in Wayne Co. Ky. Married: 15 NOV 1828 in Wayne Co. Ky. Children Mary Ann Wann b: 5 JUL 1833 in Bradley Co. Tn.
2 CONT
2 CONT Silas Wann was living with a son, Isaac William Wann and his family near Farmer, Young County, Texas in 1886 according to the Farmer Headlight. Silas Wann died at his son's home near Farmer, Texas and he is buried in the Farmer Ce
2 CONC metery, Young County, Texas.
2 CONT
