1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Served in the 60th Tennessee Company D
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan Milton Collins was captured at Big Black, Mississippi on 17 May 1863 and sent as a prisoner of war to Memphis TN on 25 May 1863. On 18 June 1863 he was sent to Fort Delaware, DE. On 26 Sep 1863 he was transferred to Point
2 CONC  Lookout, Maryland. On 15 Nov 1863 he was sent to Hammond General Hospital at Point Lookout, Maryland where he died on 11 Dec 1863. His widow was NEVER notified of his death. 
