1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Charles Lewis Higginbotham BIRTH	Jul 1796 DEATH	10 Oct 1863 (aged 67) Wayne County, Kentucky, USA BURIAL	 Pine Grove Cemetery Clinton County, Kentucky, USA  MEMORIAL ID	62138754 · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT MEMORIAL PHOTOS 1 FLOWERS 4 His parents were Oglesberry Higginbotham and Elizabeth Reed. He first married Elizabeth B. Ferguson (on 1/2/1817). She died in May of 1827. She is buried here, next to him.
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles then married Leah Payne (on 8/13/1827). He married Elizabeth Back on July 30, 1834. She was the daughter of Jacob Back and Sarah Lloyd.
