1 NOTE !      Moved to Missouri ca 1846-1847.
2 CONT !
2 CONT !     James Fletcher  "Jim" Vaught(Rin # 7360) of Somerset, KY, on July
2 CONT 30, 1989 at the Vaught Family Reunion, told Linda Dollins that Mary
2 CONT Vaught (b.30 Sept, 180l) was Mary "Polly" Hail(Rin # 2033) who married
2 CONT Isaac Vaught (Rin # 2032) and that Lucinda Vaught Higgins was the
2 CONT great, great grandmother of Vivian Merritt Vaught. (rin # 7361)(Jim
2 CONT Vaught's wife)
2 CONT !
2 CONT !     Thomas Troutman, 4231 Haiti Lane, Pasedena, TX 77505, evidently
2 CONT supplied the information about the Bible records and letter.  Permelia
2 CONT and her brother, Ephriam Vaught, sent their picture to their sister, Lucinda
2 CONT Vaught Higgins in Pulaski Co., Kentucky.
2 CONT !
2 CONT !     Book #12, pg. 762, 22 Oct, 1846....Land Deed-Isaac Vaught to Peter
2 CONT Cline, 19th Sept., 1846.
2 CONT !
2 CONT !     In 1900 Census of Scotland County, Missouri, Union Township, shows
2 CONT Ephriam Vaught as head of household and Permelia Vaught as his sister.
2 CONT Mother and Father born in  W.Virginia.
2 CONT !
