2 CONT ** Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-40001-440500761/barnabas-a-back-in-familysearch-family-tree FamilySearch Family Tree] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 10 2018, 0:13:26 UT
