2 CONT Octogenarian Dies Friday Near Camden
2 CONT
2 CONT William J. Bach, 86, native of Jackson, KY, but a resident of the Camden vicinity for the past 10 years, died Friday at the home of his daughter, Mrs. D.C. Chaney, east of Camden.
2 CONT
2 CONT Surviving are two sons, three daughters, 20 grandchildren, and 14 great-grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services and butial took place Sunday afternoon at Camden.
