1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Nancy Back (Huffman)''' was born circa 1812 in Virginia. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34777945569 Elisha Huffman] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34777945567 Elizabeth Huffman (Scales)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Nancy married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34798300436 John Wesley Back] on September 3, 1829 in Madison County, Virginia. Together they had the following 7 children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34798331928 Barbara A Back]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34798331927 Martha Back]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34798331926 Catherine Back]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34798331931 Bromby Back]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34798331933 Frances E Back]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34798331932 John Back]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34798331930 Eliza Back]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT She died between 1850 and 1860 in Madison County, Virginia. 
