1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Peter Burger (or maybe Burket) married Catherine Hines 22 Apr 1824 in Somerset, Pulaski Co., KY. Their children as far as I have been able to find out were: JACKSON BURGER born 1827; HARY ANN (POLLY) BURGER born be
2 CONC tween 1825-1830; HARRISON BURGER born 1829 (my gr-gr-gr-grandfather);ELIZABETH BURGER born c 1835; Harriette born 1835; HENRY BURGER born c 1836. I have not as yet had a chance to definitely verify these birth dates. But I'm prett
2 CONC y sure they were all born in Pulaski Co., KY.
2 CONT
2 CONT I've been given info stating that Catherine Hines Burger died and then Peter Burger married Mary Ann Harris VanHook on 3 Sept 1841( presume in Somerset, Pulaski Co., KY).
2 CONT
2 CONT The information I have is that Catherine (Hines) Burger was born c 1808 in VA; died before 1844 in Somerset, Pulaski Co., KY. Catherine's parents were WILLIAM HINES, b 25 Aug 1789 in VA; he died 15 Oct 1865 in Somerset, Pulaski Co
2 CONC ., KY; mother was BARBARA BAUGH born 12 May, 1792 in Wythe, VA; died 11 SEPT 1873 in Somerset,KY. William and Barbara married about 1806.
2 CONT
