1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Luther had three brothers, and all four of them were doctors. All three of his brothers, Bert (adopted), Arthur, and Wilgus are also buried in the Lexington Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT In January of 1936, the Works Progres Administration and the Historical Records Survey prepared a documented titled, "Breathitt County--Early Doctors." It included Dr. Luther Bach (see attached). That document stated that he and h
2 CONC is family were related to Johann Sebastian Bach. This document is available on the website for the Morehead State University, under "Scholar Works."* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/25216156/luther-bach Find A Grav
2 CONC e Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 22 2021, 19:15:53 UTC''
