2 CONT ~~~ Obituary taken from The Galena Republican, Friday, May 8, 1936:  
2 CONT
2 CONT "Mrs. Ellen Back is Dead;
2 CONT  Funeral Held in Oswego"  
2 CONT
2 CONT "Mrs. Ellen Back, 65 years old, of Baxter Springs, a former Galena resident, died Friday morning at 5:30 o'clock in Freeman hospital in Joplin following a long illness.  Mrs. Back had moved to Baxter Springs from here only recentl
2 CONC y.  She is survived by nine sons and two daughters.  Funeral services were held Sunday in Oswego at the First Baptist church."
2 CONT
2 CONT (Thank you to Marilyn Schmitt, President of the Cherokee County Kansas Genealogical-Historical Society for this obituary)
