1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Notes from Patricia Riley Caudill
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrew Jackson CLEMONS (Benjamin1), M. Born in Jun 1845 in Breathitt County, Kentucky.
2 CONT
2 CONT He first did not marry Ally (Alice) JONES, F, daughter of Wiley JONES, M & Elizabeth BUTTERY, F. Born 1843 - 1849.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had one child: 	100	i.	Daniel Green JONES, M (Jan 1865-)
2 CONT
2 CONT Abt 1870 when Andrew Jackson was 24, he second married Elizabeth BACK, F, daughter of Samuel David BACK, M (Mar 4, 1817-) & Rhoda Malinda DAY, F, in Breathitt County, Kentucky. Born in 1847.7
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children: 	101	i.	Samuel, M (1871-) 	102	ii.	Jane, F 	103	iii.	Rebecca, F (1873-) 	104	iv.	Rhoda M., F (May 1875-) 	105	v.	Andrew Jackson (Jackie), M (Aug 28, 1876-Dec 30, 1939) 	106	vi.	Wilson C., M (Apr 18
2 CONC 79-) 	107	vii.	Marion, M (Jun 1883-) 	108	viii.	Rachel, F (Feb 1887-)
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1892 when Andrew Jackson was 46, he third married Elizabeth COOPER7, F.7 Born in Aug 1848.7
2 CONT
2 CONT They had one child: 	109	i.	Elizabeth (Betty), F (1893-)
2 CONT
2 CONT *****************************
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT His brother was married to Alice Jones sister. He was married and had an affair with Alice and she conceived Dan Green Jones out of wedlock. ________________________________________________________ Military Service: U.S. Veterans 
