1 NOTE {geni:about_me} James Caudill Dixon was the son of John Westly and Pheobe (Caudill) Dixon.  He married first to Evelyn "Eva" Back on July 12, 1896, in Letcher County, KY.  They had six children: Florence Dixon, Etta Bea (Dixon) Ca
2 CONC udill, Murial Joy (Dixon) Caudill, Ralph Dixon, Nora Cecil (Dixon) Asher and Anna Beulah Dixon.  James married second to Lucinda Campbell on February 6, 1915, in Letcher County, KY.  They had four children: Mary Edith (Dixon) Moor
2 CONC e Roark, James Laurence Dixon, Lillian Mae (Dixon) Monhollin and Rebecca Ruth (Dixon) Warner.
