2 CONT Obituary, John L. Dobbs, published January 28, 1988, in The Leader and the Kalkaskian (Kalkaska, MI), p. 10.
2 CONT
2 CONT John L. Dobbs, 87, of Northville, a retired Detroit policeman, died Tuesday.
2 CONT Jan. 19, 1988, at St. Mary's Hospital in Livonia. Mr. Dobbs made his home in Kalkaska County from 1947 to 1967, following his retirement from the Detroit Police Department. He was bom in Burnside, Kentucky May 8, 1900, to John and
2 CONC  Mary Dobbs. He was married in 1925 to Bessie Hyde, in Detroit. She died Feb. 23, 1966. Surviving are one son, Roy Dobbs of Northville; eight grandchildren; 24 great-grandchildren; and two great-great-grandchildren. He was precede
2 CONC d in death by one daughter, Arilla Woodside, and four brothers and four sisters. Graveside services were held Friday, Feb. 2 at Lodi Cemetery, Kalkaska County. Arrangements were made by Wolfe Funeral Home, Kalkaska.
