2 CONT MILLER--Of diphtheria, November 7, 1896, little Glen, only child of Mr. and Mrs. Ed. S. Miller, aged 2 years, 10 months and 13 days.  Glen was an unusually bright child and his death is a severe blow to his parents.  They have the
