1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Obituary - Mrs. Sarah Elizabeth Wolfe, 86, Holton, died Friday night in a hospital here.  She had been ill several months.  She was born July 11, 1883, Hancock County, TN, and lived in Virginia before she moved to the Holton commu
2 CONC nity 55 years ago.  She was a member of First Christian Church of Holton.  Her husband, Andrew H. Wolfe, died in 1951.  Survivors include eight daughters, two sons, a brother, several half sisters and brothers, several grandchildr
2 CONC en and great grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the motivation for annual family reunions while she was still alive.  Often over 100 relatives from 5 generations would gather in Holton to visit and pay their respects to "grandma".
