2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/67134182/nancy_wolfe Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 26 2024, 9:40:13 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Residence''': 1860 - Russell, Virginia, United States
