1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Eliza Anna Baugh Fields
2 CONT BIRTH
2 CONT Sep 1863
2 CONT Lawrence County, Indiana, USA
2 CONT DEATH
2 CONT 12 Jul 1936 (aged 72)
2 CONT West Terre Haute, Vigo County, Indiana, USA
2 CONT BURIAL
2 CONT Bethesda Cemetery
2 CONT Sugar Creek Township, Vigo County, Indiana, USA 
2 CONT MEMORIAL ID
2 CONT 14537345 · View Source
2 CONT MEMORIAL
2 CONT PHOTOS 1
2 CONT FLOWERS 4
2 CONT Eliza Anna Baugh Fields; b. Sep 1864 in Lawrence Co., IN; dau of Jacob and Margaret (George) Baugh. Married: Clark Robert Fields in Sims Twp., Edgar Co., IL. on Oct. 3, 1883. They had 9 children: Levy, Wm. Arthur, Cora E., Bertha 
2 CONC M., Margaret A., Albert F., Clarence E., Clark Robt. (aka Robert), and Marie. She died 12 July 1936 in W. Terre Haute, Vigo Co., IN.
2 CONT ~
2 CONT MRS. ANNA FIELDS: 13 July 1936 – Tribune, p.2 – {b. 1864} Mrs. Anna Fields, 72 years old, died Sunday. She is survived by the husband, Clark; three daughters, Mrs. Margaret Smith, Mrs. Marie Fennell and Mrs. Cora Stevens; four son
2 CONC s, Albert, Arthur, Robert and Clarence; two brothers, Andrew and Alfred Baugh. Burial will be in Bethesda cemetery.(NOTE: Maiden name Eliza Anna Baugh, daughter of Jacob Baugh and Margaret George)
