2 CONT Funeral services will beheld at 10:00 AM Tuesday from the Schlintz and Moore Funeral Home Centerville Chapel, 820 W. Centerville Rd, (Rt 7245) with burial to follow at Davids Cemetery.  Family will receive friends from 6-8 PM Mond
2 CONC ay at the funeral home.  Those wishing may make contributions to Hospice of Dayton.
2 CONT
