1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Blanche had pneumonia as a teenager. After that, she never washed or even cut her hair. She combed it with a fine bone comb and wore it in a bun. She and Henry had no wedding photo taken, and when Anna Belle was 5,
2 CONC  they had their first family portrait that she always referred to as her wedding photo. She was an avid quilter, making hand-tied crazy quilts from feed sacks to velvet scraps. All were intricately embroidered. Contributor: Kerry 
2 CONC Szymanski (49782268)
