1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Vonda Louise Frizzell, daughter of Henry W. and Blanche D. Miller, was born near Island City, MO.  She married Edgar F. Frizzell on 28 May 1962 in Kansas City and lived in Kansas City where she died.  She was a dry
