1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/97269404/vincent-louis-kubat
2 CONT When Vincent Louis Kubat was born on 20 October 1873, in Steele, Minnesota, United States, his father, Anton John Kubat, was 30 and his mother, Paulina A. Rypka, was 28. He married Rozena Mary Mottl on 28 May 1901, in Owatonna, St
2 CONC eele, Minnesota, United States. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 6 daughters. He lived in Owatonna Township, Steele, Minnesota, United States in 1885 and Havana Township, Steele, Minnesota, United States for about 35 y
2 CONC ears. He died on 25 May 1947, in Owatonna, Steele, Minnesota, United States, at the age of 73, and was buried in Owatonna, Steele, Minnesota, United States.
2 CONT Contributor: Danny J. Lulf (47215266)
