1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT From Alice´s obituary we learn that she lived to be ninety-eight years old. "Alice Wavrin was born March 4, 1891, in Steele county. In Sept 1911, she married Anton Kovar, in Owatonna. The couple farmed on the Kovar family homestea
2 CONC d until 1941. After her husband's death, Mrs. Kovar continued to live on the farm until 1955 when she moved into Owatonna. Mrs. Kovar was a homemaker. She was a member of the VFW Auxiliary." One wonders who was the veteran in the 
2 CONC family. All three are buried at Bohemian National Cemetery in Owatonna.
