1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Desiree_Gruber
2 CONT
2 CONT Desiree Gruber (born June 25, 1967) is an American television producer and entrepreneur. She was the executive producer of the fashion reality television competition Project Runway[1][2] and the co-creator of Theodora and Callum, 
2 CONC "an accessories-based line inspired by world travel."[3] She is also the founder and CEO of a production company, Full Picture.
