1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Died at his home in Pepin county.  Born in Berlin, N.Y. and came to that county (Pepin,Wi.) in 1857, residing on the same farm ever since.  Served in the War of the Rebellion 3 yrs, enlisted Aug. 13 1862, 25th Wi. 
2 CONC Inf. co. G and marched with Sherman to the sea.  Leaves a wife,(Thankful) one son and 2 daughters, including Mrs. LeRoy Hotchkiss of this city.
2 CONT ____________________________________________________________
2 CONT Son of Jabez, of Jonathan Jr., of Jonathan Sr., of Solomon and Thankful. 
