2 CONT ERNEST AYERS SUCCUMBS
2 CONT
2 CONT Ernest Ayers, 84, a Glendo resident for many years, passed away Saturday, Nov. 30, shortly after admittance into Memorial Hospital, Wheatland. Services were planned for 10:30 a.m. Wednesday, Dec. 4, at Schrader Funeral Home in Whe
2 CONC atland. He is survived by daughters, Mrs. Iola Stewart of Wheatland and Mrs. Gene Vinar of Guernsey, and sons Howard Ayers of Lander and Eldon Ayers of Casper. Nine grandchildren and 13 great-grandchildren also survive.
2 CONT
2 CONT © Douglas Budget, December 5, 1968
