1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Burnam was born in Taney County, Missouri and later returned with his family to Breathitt County, Kentucky.  There he married Laura Belle Patton and they had two children, John Wallace and Mary Joyce.  He worked as
2 CONC  a coal loader for a time before moving to Cincinnati, Ohio to work in a metal company 9 years before his death.  On returning to the area with his family for either a wedding or a funeral he was seriously injured in a car acciden
2 CONC t in Stanton, Ky, on July 30, 1948. He passed away on August 3rd, 1948 at a Lexington hospital.
