2 CONT Nancy (Jones) Ison was the daughter of Joseph "Joe" and Rachel (Boggs) Jones. She married Bony Ison on February 1, 1920, in Ice, Letcher County, KY. They had thirteen children: Geneva (Ison) Banks, Earnest Ison, Gideon Ison, Blanc
2 CONC h (Ison) Banks, Anna J. (Ison) Banks, Franklin Ison, Henry Lindburgh Ison, Irvine Ison, Donald G. Ison, Mallie (Ison) Eldridge, Magalene (Ison) Brashear, Wallene Ison and Loren D. Ison.
