1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maxie Townsend Keeton, 74, Winchester
2 CONT March 27, 2013
2 CONT
2 CONT Maxie Townsend Keeton, 74, of Winchester, wife of Clyde Keeton, passed away Tuesday at her home. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Maxie was preceded in death by her first husband, Leonard Townsend; parents Crit and Susan (Caudill) Eldridge; brothers Enos, James, Preston, Page, Pierce, and Mark; sisters Vera Blair, Christina Preston, Vada Whittaker, Tessie, a
2 CONC nd Mallie Baber. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She is survived her second husband, Clyde Keeton; one son, Leonard Douglas Townsend, Winchester, KY; one daughter Diana Lynn Raney, Winchester, KY; sister Lilly Newman.
2 CONT
2 CONT Four grandchildren; Mathew Douglas Townsend, Jesse Daniel Townsend, Bryan Crit Raney,and Courtney Young Raney.
2 CONT
2 CONT Three great-grandchildren; Tia Renee Townsend, Savannah Brook Townsend, Joshua Douglas Townsend.
