1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ethel Marie Blair was born November 26, 1907 in Hindman, Knott County, Kentucky USA. Daughter of Henry Blair and Etta Young. She died November 3, 1995 in Medina, Medina County, Ohio USA and is buried with her lovin
2 CONC g husband of 67 years, Shiloh Alvis Fields and daughter June Marie Fields in Spring Grove Cemetery, Medina, Medina county, Ohio USA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ethel and Shiloh had two children: Robert H. Fields 1929-2001 June Marie Fields 1940-2002
2 CONT
2 CONT Ethel owned and operated Artistic Beauty Shop in Medina, Ohio with her daughter June. She was also a wonderful homemaker.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ethel was a member of the United Methodist Church and a Pythian Sister.
