1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He married Christie Back, about January 28th, 1885 in Morgan County, Kentucky.  While a shared headstone exists for Christie and her husband in the Back Cemetery in Menifee County, Kentucky, death certificates indi
2 CONC cate that they were buried in separate cemeteries.
