2 CONT
2 CONT Name: COOPER, AVERY J JR
2 CONT Rank & Branch: COL US ARMY
2 CONT War Period: WORLD WAR II, KOREA
2 CONT Date of Birth: 01/30/1912
2 CONT Date of Death: 05/15/1997
2 CONT Buried At: SECTION AI SITE 292
2 CONT Cemetery: FT. SAM HOUSTON NATIONAL CEMETERY
2 CONT
2 CONT Col. Avery John Cooper, Jr. was a former comandant of the Ft. Sam Houston base. Buried on the quadrangle.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a graduate of the United States Military Academy West Point (West Point, NY) - Class of 1933
2 CONT
2 CONT Military Information: COL, US ARMY
2 CONT
