1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Pierce H. Wade was a member of 17th Ordnance.  
2 CONT He fought on Bataan and became a Prisoner of War on April 9, 1942.  
2 CONT He took part in the Bataan Death March and was held as a POW at Camp O'Donnell.  
2 CONT He escaped and fought as a guerrilla against the Japanese.  
2 CONT Wade received the Silver Star for raiding a Japanese Hospital and stealing medical supplies that saved the lives of his men who were suffering from malaria, dysnetery, and beriberi.  
2 CONT He was recaptured and tortured. He would later be sent to Japan on a hell ship and remained there until liberated
2 CONT -JimO
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/57865081/pierce-herring-wade Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jan 15 2023, 16:38:10 UTC''
