0 @N6000000001574227458@ NOTE Note: Ruth Walton has in her notes that Noah second married Rosa King; however, she also says that John W. Green, Noah's brother, married Rosa King. I have asked her for clarification on  this, and have not entered her as a spouse
1 CONC  of Noah.
1 CONT
1 CONT In July 1999, Ruth reports that "Paxton" says that Noah's second wife "was a King," and that she has not record of Rosa (relating to Noah), only that she was a King. Paxton also says that they had 3 children.
1 CONT
1 CONT Noah is found on the 1880 census of Platte County, MO with wife Zerilda (age 18, b. MO, parents b. KY), living next to his parents in Preston. His name is spelled "Greene" on the census.
